        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Nick Broomfield\n- Works: a follow-up documentary, an earlier documentary\n- Places: Jordan\n- Concepts: Cinema of Jordan, Jollywood, European-ethnicity slang terms\n\nFacts:\n- Nick Broomfield made an earlier documentary that was followed by another documentary.\n- The follow-up documentary takes its title from a slang term applied to European ethnicities.\n- The follow-up documentary was shot in Jordan.\n- The follow-up documentary is described as an example of the Cinema of Jordan, also called Jollywood.",
